Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 00:41:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] test4dt: neutralizar telemetria posthog do chromadb
 (KeyError matava runs)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Mesmo patch do marta/embedding.py: a telemetria posthog do chromadb da KeyError
em batched_events durante queries RAG em thread (matou o httpie no marta aos
170min). Settings(anonymized_telemetry=False) + monkey-patch da .capture().
Os avisos 'capture() takes 1 positional argument' ja apareciam no log da
baseline → vulneravel ao mesmo crash.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 test4dt/embedding.py | 16 +++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/test4dt/embedding.py b/test4dt/embedding.py
index c0b156d..855f712 100644
--- a/test4dt/embedding.py
+++ b/test4dt/embedding.py
@@ -6,6 +6,20 @@ from transformers import AutoTokenizer, AutoModel
 import torch
 from typing import List
 import chromadb
+from chromadb.config import Settings
+# Bulletproof: a telemetria posthog do chromadb dá KeyError em batched_events
+# (matou o httpie no marta aos 170min) e o Settings(anonymized_telemetry=False)
+# sozinho NÃO a desliga (os avisos "capture() takes 1 positional argument"
+# persistem — singleton global). Neutralizar a .capture() diretamente. Sem
+# efeito funcional (é só analytics).
+try:
+    import chromadb.telemetry.product.posthog as _cph
+    for _n in dir(_cph):
+        _c = getattr(_cph, _n)
+        if isinstance(_c, type) and hasattr(_c, "capture"):
+            _c.capture = lambda *a, **k: None
+except Exception:
+    pass
 
 
 class HuggingFaceEmbedder(Embeddings):
@@ -119,5 +133,5 @@ class FunctionDatabase:
 
 load_dotenv()
 embedder = HuggingFaceEmbedder(model_name_or_path=os.getenv('TRANSFORMER_PATH') or '')
-client = chromadb.Client()
+client = chromadb.Client(Settings(anonymized_telemetry=False))
 function_database = FunctionDatabase()
